sequenceDiagram
  actor Custodian
  participant Desk as LoanDesk boundary
  participant Control as LoanControl
  participant Reservation
  participant Equipment
  participant Loan
  participant MaintenanceCase
  participant AuditLog
  Custodian->>Desk: Select confirmed reservation and verify identity
  Desk->>Control: Checkout reservation
  Control->>Reservation: Check requester, status and time window
  Control->>Equipment: Check physical availability
  alt Legal checkout
    Control->>Loan: Create ACTIVE possession
    Control->>Reservation: Mark FULFILLED
    Control->>Equipment: Mark ON_LOAN
    Control->>AuditLog: Record checkout
    Control-->>Desk: Handover recorded
  else Illegal checkout
    Control-->>Desk: Refuse handover without partial changes
  end
  Custodian->>Desk: Physically receive equipment and assess condition
  Desk->>Control: Return ACTIVE loan
  Control->>Loan: Record receipt and late-return fact
  opt Damaged
    Control->>MaintenanceCase: Create linked OPEN case
  end
  Control->>Equipment: Recompute with retired and maintenance precedence
  Control->>AuditLog: Record return
  Control-->>Desk: Return recorded
